  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato, capsicum and red onion (see ingredients) into bite-sized chunks.\n• Trim ends of asparagus and cut into thirds.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Set aside to cool slightly.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689ec77c0fe946c7f5532611/step-ac718b00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate zucchini, then squeeze out any excess moisture with a paper towel.\n• Roughly chop dill.\n• TIP: Removing excess liquid from the veggies will help the fritters crisp up in the pan!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689ec77c0fe946c7f5532611/step-1f231210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine zucchini, dill, Cheddar cheese, the plain flour, stock concentrate and the egg.\n• Add the salt, a pinch of pepper and chilli flakes (if using). Mix well to combine.\n• TIP: Lift out some of the mixture with a spoon. If it's too wet and doesn't hold its shape, add a little more flour!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689ec77c0fe946c7f5532611/step-d5482b20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, add heaped tablespoons of the fritter mixture in batches and flatten with a spatula. Cook until golden, 3-4 minutes each side (don’t flip too early!). You should get 3-4 fritters per person.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.\n• TIP: Add extra olive oil between batches as needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689ec77c0fe946c7f5532611/step-f0d98730.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the fritters are cooking, add Birch & Waite Green Goddess Dressing to a second medium bowl.\n• Add gourmet leaf mix, pepitas and the slightly cooled roast veggies. Gently toss to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689ec77c0fe946c7f5532611/step-28e25740.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide cheesy zucchini fritters and veggie salad with Birch & Waite Green Goddess Dressing between plates.\n• Serve with babaganoush. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689ec77c0fe946c7f5532611/step-face2e50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
